  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and saute until fragrant.",
    "Add the myeongnan-roe and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add the soy sauce, lemon juice, chili flakes, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a flambe, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped green onions and a side of cauliflower rice.",
    "Make sure to cook the myeongnan-roe to an internal temperature of 145 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Let the dish rest for 5 minutes before serving."
